1.1	Brief History
uZuri skincare clinic was established in 2024 in Richardsbay, KwaZulu Natal, South Africa. Founded by Siphesihle Madlala, a young skincare specialist with the vision to offer luxury and skincare treatments at an affordable price. The clinic began as a small aesthetic practice specializing in facials and acne treatments and has since expanded its services to include chemical peels, microneedling, laser therapy, and advanced anti-aging treatments. The business currently has 1branch located in 12 Junction Shopping Centre Bullion Blvd, Richardsbay central. In the year 2025, uZuri skincare clinic was recognised at the Aesthetic Medicine Awards as the most innovative upcoming female-owned beauty clinic. The same year uZuri skincare clinic collaborated with Lo’real to create the new range that focuses on quality skincare products for people with skincare conditions such as eczema etc. This range was successful as it was also recognised by other global companies and consumers. uZuri skincare clinic is a proud member of Dermatology Society of South Africa (DASSA).

1.2	Mission Statement
To provide quality skincare treatments at an affordable price.

1.3	Vision Statement
To be the most celebrated skincare clinic and be recognised globally for our commitment to excellence, sustainability and quality skincare treatments.

1.4	Target Audience
uZuri skincare clinic targets individuals that are active, health -conscious adults ranging from the ages 18-65. We target individuals interested in preventative health, immune support systems or individuals simply wanting to enhance their looks.


