5. DESIGN AND USER EXPERIENCE
5.1 Design Aesthetic and branding 
The website design will reflect uZuri skincare clinic identity, which is a warm, welcoming calm, floral space. The page should feel refreshing and calming to look at. Getting skincare treatment should be a relaxing and refreshing experience hence the website should reflect uZuri skincare clinic calming space and experience. 
Design style	Modern floral luxury look
Inspiration
Aesthetic	Warm tropical, luxury

5.2 Layout and Design approach 
• Full-screen hero video or high-quality photograph on the homepage with an overlay booking widget 
• Grid-based room display with hover effects revealing treatment lists and a direct 'Book Now' CTA 
• Sticky navigation bar that transitions from transparent to solid gold on scroll
 • Generous whitespace to create a premium, uncluttered feel
5.3 User Experience
• Navigation — Maximum three-click depth to any page; primary navigation with clear dropdown menus 
• Accessibility — WCAG 2.1 AA compliant; adequate colour contrast, alt text for all images, keyboard navigation 
• Booking Flow — Streamlined 3-step booking process: Select Dates → Choose Room → Confirm & Pay
 • Page Load Speed — Target under 2.5 seconds; lazy image loading, CDN implementation
 • Trust Signals — Prominently displayed star ratings, security badges, and guest testimonials


 
